WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.334
-Guys, I know a lot of
people find math boring.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.734
Well, that's why
we've updated math

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:06.267
to make equations be about
stuff that you can relate to.

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:08.267
It's time for
"Popular Mathematics."

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.601
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:12.033
-♪ Popular ♪

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:13.567
♪ Mathematics ♪

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:15.501
♪ Mathematics ♪

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:17.767
-Let's take a look at
our first equation here.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:21.334
If you take a check mark
plus a dad bod,

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:23.834
it equals the Nike logo.

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:28.367
See what I'm saying?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.901 --> 00:00:33.234
So, then if you take a
streaming service

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:35.634
plus the movie
"Gone in 60 Seconds,"

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:38.033
it equals CNN+.

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:41.901
It makes you like math again.

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:43.934
Here's another one.

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:47.133
Mexican culture
plus Italian culture

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:48.267
plus a middle finger

00:00:48.267 --> 00:00:51.434
equals Taco Bell's
Mexican pizza.

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:54.968
I'm still going to try it.

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:57.534
I'm still going to try it and
I'll probably like it.

00:00:57.534 --> 00:00:59.701
If you take an old-school camera

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:02.067
plus shooting
the whole roll of film

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:05.067
plus forgetting to take off
the lens cap,

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:08.133
it equals Kodak Black.

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:10.100
You understand?

00:01:12.267 --> 00:01:14.801
And, finally,
if you take positive vibes

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:17.067
plus positive COVID test,
it equals Coachella.

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:18.434
There you go.

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:20.801
That's all the time we have for
"Popular Mathematics."

